<title>USA: Frontier Corp sells $300 mln notes.</title>
<headline>Frontier Corp sells $300 mln notes.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following debt issue from Frontier Corp was priced on Wednesday, according to lead manager Salomon Brothers Inc.</p>
<p>Frontier Corp offers cellular, local, and long distance services to customers.</p>
<p>BORROWER FRONTIER CORP</p>
<p>AMT $300 MLN	 COUPON 7.25 PCT   MATURITY 5/15/2004</p>
<p>TYPE NOTES	   ISS PRICE 99.966  FIRST PAY DATE 11/15/1997</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S A3    YIELD 7.527 PCT   PAY FREQ  SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P SINGLE-A  SPREAD +58 BP     MAKE-WHOLE CALL AT +10</p>
<p>						   BP OVER U.S. TREASURIES</p>
<p>((--U.S. Corporate Bond Unit, 212 859-    ))</p>
</text>
